msgstr "قد إيه يفكر"

#: reading/models.py:116
msgid "read each page twice and compare"
msgstr "قراءة كل صفحة مرتين والمقارنة"

#: reading/models.py:117
msgid ""
"Where the two readings differ, the field is marked for checking. It catches "
